          Feature Test Macro Requirements for glibc (see
          ffeeaattuurree__tteesstt__mmaaccrrooss(7)):

              aacccctt(): _BSD_SOURCE || (_XOPEN_SOURCE && _XOPEN_SOURCE < 500)

       The  ||||  means  that in order to obtain the declaration of aacccctt(2) from
